<title>USA: Commonwealth Energy move to cut $20 mln cost.</title>
<headline>Commonwealth Energy move to cut $20 mln cost.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commonwealth Energy System said Thursday it is consolidating management of two units in a move intended to cut annual operating expenses by about $20 million.</p>
<p>The move will result in the elimination of about 15 percent of jobs system wide and is hoped to be accomplished through attrition and under a personnel reduction program, the company said.</p>
